=== Trapezium

==== Area, knowing base and height

// TODO: Convert TikZ diagram to CeTZ
// Original TikZ: Trapezium with bases B and b, and height h

$ A = ((B + b)h)/2 $

==== Area knowing only sides

// TODO: Convert TikZ diagram to CeTZ
// Original TikZ: Trapezium with all sides labeled a, b, c, d

$ e = (d^2 - b^2 + a^2 - 2a c + c^2)/(2a - 2c) $

$ h = sqrt(d^2 - e^2) $

$ A = (h(a+c))/2 $
